        "date": "2026-11-20T17:08:52Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge main into issue/2088-shallow-floor-levels\n\nClear-out refresh of PR #2678 against origin/main 768fe23f0\n(merged #2149 included).\n\nConflicted file and resolution:\n- crates/motion/src/machining3d/entry.rs (3 hunks: the use line,\n  run_plain_with, run_rest_with): keep the PR's\n  floor_levels::cut_levels(facets, p, stepdown) depth ladder and main's\n  AdaptiveMethod `method` argument on ladder(...). The PR's cut_levels\n  calls main's cut_levels_under(p.top_z, p.links.approach.stock_top,\n  p.bottom_z, stepdown) with the same arguments first, so main's level\n  law, its Top Z stock level and its pass-budget refusal stay. The\n  direct cut_levels_under import leaves entry.rs (no caller is left).\n\nAll other files merged without a conflict. The inherited #2149 diff\n(project files, verifier, UI) is now main's own: the PR's diff against\nmain is its five #2088 files only.\n\nRefs #2088\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
