      },
      "message": "fix(motion): keep the plain level law on the rotary air-split ladder\n\nThe shallow-floor discovery of #2088 also ran in pocket3d_air_split,\nwhich only the rotary wrap calls. In the wrap a flat face is a turned\nskin, so the discovery added a level at the foot of the window v 0..8,\nand rotary_offset::the_height_window_names_the_stations_and_refuses_an_empty_one\ngot a toolpath where the law says air. The air-split ladder now uses\ncut_levels_under again. The pin\nblind_floor::the_rotary_air_split_ladder_keeps_the_plain_level_law shows\nthat pocket3d cuts the shallow floor and the air-split ladder refuses it.\n\nRefs #2088\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
